   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я сам дойду до дивана.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will reach the sofa myself.' Samson insists that he is able to walk on his own feet.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Считай, ты родился под счастливой звездой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Consider that you were born under a lucky star.' The Russian idiom describes surviving remarkable fortune.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Мне хватило на сегодня этих джедаев.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I have had enough of these Jedis today.' Samson complains about the bizarre martial artists.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Юля, дай аптечку скорее!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yulia, bring the first aid kit quickly!' Nina urgently asks their daughter for medical supplies.",
