   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Не надо никакую аптечку нести.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'There is no need to bring any first aid kit.' Samson stubbornly brushes off his wife's concern.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Меня уже обкололи сегодня врачи.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The doctors already gave me injections today.' The colloquial verb refers to receiving medical shots.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "yulia",
   "t": "Мама, посмотри скорее на телевизор!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
