   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'They are showing people's candidate Samsonov there!' The television news reports on Ivan's eccentric campaign.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Все говорят, а Самсонов делает!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Everyone talks, but Samsonov acts!' The campaign catchphrase contrasts mere empty words with decisive action.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "yulia",
   "t": "А теперь перешли к другим новостям.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And now they moved on to other news.' The television announcer transitions to the next news story.",
   "gap": 0.4
